{{!-- What the Failed and Completed tabs keep, and where that is set: rendered under the state's
      description in the queue page's card header, nothing for the other states. Context: the
      page's `queue` (its `keepsFinished` picks the export wording), `state`, `retention`
      (describeRetention) and `failedContent.limits`;
      the route provides the last two for these states only. --}}
{{#equals state.name "failed"}}
<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm mt-1 mb-0">
    {{#if queue.keepsFinished}}
    The most recent {{formatInteger retention.failedCount userLocale}} are kept for
    {{ngettext '%d day' '%d days' retention.failedAgeDays}}.
    {{#if retention.failedCountFromSetting}}
    The count follows the completed job history limit in
    <a href="/admin/config/service#queue_settings" class="link link-animated">General settings</a>, which is above the
    floor of {{formatInteger retention.failedCountFloor userLocale}} set with <code>EENGINE_QUEUE_KEEP_FAILED</code>;
    {{else}}
    The count is set with <code>EENGINE_QUEUE_KEEP_FAILED</code>, or by the completed job history limit in
    <a href="/admin/config/service#queue_settings" class="link link-animated">General settings</a> when that is higher;
    {{/if}}
    the age with <code>EENGINE_QUEUE_KEEP_FAILED_AGE</code>.
    {{#equals queue.name "submit"}}
    {{#if failedContent.limits.keepsContent}}
    The content of the {{formatInteger failedContent.limits.maxCount userLocale}} most recent failed messages is kept
    so they can be retried, up to {{failedContent.limits.maxBytesLabel}} in total, set with
    <code>EENGINE_QUEUE_KEEP_FAILED_CONTENT</code> and <code>EENGINE_QUEUE_KEEP_FAILED_CONTENT_SIZE</code>.
    {{else}}
    The content of a failed message is not kept, so none can be retried from here; set
    <code>EENGINE_QUEUE_KEEP_FAILED_CONTENT</code> to keep some.
    {{/if}}
    {{/equals}}
    {{else}}
    Exports are not kept here once they fail; an export's outcome is on its account's page.
    {{/if}}
</p>
{{/equals}}
{{#equals state.name "completed"}}
<p class="text-base-content/60 text-sm mt-1 mb-0">
    {{#if queue.keepsFinished}}
    {{#if retention.completedCount}}
    The most recent {{formatInteger retention.completedCount userLocale}} are kept for at most a day, as set by
    {{else}}
    Removed as soon as they finish. To keep the most recent ones for a day, raise
    {{/if}}
    the completed job history limit in
    <a href="/admin/config/service#queue_settings" class="link link-animated">General settings</a>.
    {{else}}
    Exports are not kept here once they finish; an export's result is on its account's page.
    {{/if}}
</p>
{{/equals}}
